{"version":1,"content":"<p>知名科技YouTuber Marques Brownlee（MKBHD）在體驗蘋果首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo兩個多星期後，最終決定重新換回iPhone 18 Pro。這一選擇並不是因為他否定摺疊屏手機的價值，而是經過一段時間的日常使用後，他發現傳統旗艦機型仍然更符合自己的實際需求。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584874.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T14:01:26.087613+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:39:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:21.528940+00:00","content_hash":"33768cb9b6bc05eb9f7b10c357625737ebc79f9763b18a621f734c49cdbbc886","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}